  "translation": "Today is Sunday. I go to the supermarket with my mom to buy things. The supermarket is next to our home; we walk there. There are many people in the supermarket. We first buy fruit; mom buys apples and bananas. Then we go to buy milk; the milk is in the supermarket. I take a cup of milk. We also want to buy bread; the bread is next to the bakery. We buy bread and eggs. Then we go home; I help mom carry things. Today is really happy."
